        <selectionEntryGroup name="Weapon Options" id="f992-9b93-1577-3802" hidden="false" page="55" publicationId="4e98-876c-e24d-4d7d" sortIndex="2">
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name="Exterminators" id="758e-accd-27f7-4c79" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="4261-05cd-115c-d1c4" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <modifiers>
                <modifier field="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" type="increment" value="3">
                  <repeats>
                    <repeat childId="model" field="selections" repeats="1" roundUp="false" scope="parent" shared="true" value="1"/>
                  </repeats>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Exterminators" id="09dd-fe29-52ff-b3b5" hidden="false" page="55" publicationId="4e98-876c-e24d-4d7d">
                  <description>Exterminators may be used once per battle the first time the Zealots charge an enemy. They are used in the first round of the assault at Initiative 8 and their use does not prevent the model from making attacks at their normal Initiative later in the combat. 


For each model equipped with Exterminators rolls a single D6. The number needed to hit is dependent on the number of Exterminators in the unit at the time they are used. Each hit causes a Strength 4 hit with an Armour Piecing value of 5.


Number of Models
1-5: 6+ to hit
6-10: 5+ to hit
11-15: 4+ to hit
16+: 3+ to hit</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
